{"id":"c6bd75228eeab645","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-maxsatthreequarters.md","title":"Combined rounding bound of three quarters for Max Sat","display":"thm-maxsatthreequarters — Combined rounding bound of three quarters for Max Sat","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-maxsatthreequarters","aliases":["27-thm-maxsatthreequarters"],"display":"thm-maxsatthreequarters — Combined rounding bound of three quarters for Max Sat","depends_on":["[[27-df-maxsat]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§2.11.4 Theorems 2.28–2.29; Lemma 2.1","source_printed_pages":"119,120","source_pdf_pages":"143,144","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note","local_review_status":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-maxsatthreequarters"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-maxsatthreequarters</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-maxsatthreequarters — Combined rounding bound of three quarters for Max Sat"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"88afb3e9aa26fa43\" href=\"?note=88afb3e9aa26fa43\" title=\"27-df-maxsat\">27-df-maxsat</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2.11.4 Theorems 2.28–2.29; Lemma 2.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"119,120"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"143,144"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_k,A_k,B_k,w_k,W,W^*\">\\(C_k,A_k,B_k,w_k,W,W^*\\)</span> 及其全部输入条件如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"88afb3e9aa26fa43\" href=\"?note=88afb3e9aa26fa43\" title=\"27-df-maxsat\">27-df-maxsat</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_k=|A_k|+|B_k|\\ge1\">\\(d_k=|A_k|+|B_k|\\ge1\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:[0,1]^n\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(F:[0,1]^n\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span> 在下节构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x^{\\mathrm{LP}},z^{\\mathrm{LP}})\">\\((x^{\\mathrm{LP}},z^{\\mathrm{LP}})\\)</span> 是有界线性规划 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\max\\{\\sum_k w_kz_k\\mid(x,z)\\in[0,1]^n\\times[0,1]^m,\\ \\forall k\\in[m]\\;z_k\\le\\sum_{i\\in A_k}(1-x_i)+\\sum_{j\\in B_k}x_j\\}\">\\(\\max\\{\\sum_k w_kz_k\\mid(x,z)\\in[0,1]^n\\times[0,1]^m,\\ \\forall k\\in[m]\\;z_k\\le\\sum_{i\\in A_k}(1-x_i)+\\sum_{j\\in B_k}x_j\\}\\)</span> 的最优解，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W^{\\mathrm{LP}}\">\\(W^{\\mathrm{LP}}\\)</span> 是下节构造的该最优解的目标值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F(x)\\coloneqq\\sum_{k=1}^m w_k\\left(1-\\prod_{i\\in A_k}x_i\\prod_{j\\in B_k}(1-x_j)\\right)\\quad(x\\in[0,1]^n),\\qquad W^{\\mathrm{LP}}\\coloneqq\\sum_{k=1}^m w_kz_k^{\\mathrm{LP}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F(x)\\coloneqq\\sum_{k=1}^m w_k\\left(1-\\prod_{i\\in A_k}x_i\\prod_{j\\in B_k}(1-x_j)\\right)\\quad(x\\in[0,1]^n),\\qquad W^{\\mathrm{LP}}\\coloneqq\\sum_{k=1}^m w_kz_k^{\\mathrm{LP}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\max\\{F(\\tfrac12,\\ldots,\\tfrac12),F(x^{\\mathrm{LP}})\\}\\ge\\tfrac12\\left(F(\\tfrac12,\\ldots,\\tfrac12)+F(x^{\\mathrm{LP}})\\right)\\ge\\tfrac34 W^{\\mathrm{LP}}\\ge\\tfrac34 W^*.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\max\\{F(\\tfrac12,\\ldots,\\tfrac12),F(x^{\\mathrm{LP}})\\}\\ge\\tfrac12\\left(F(\\tfrac12,\\ldots,\\tfrac12)+F(x^{\\mathrm{LP}})\\right)\\ge\\tfrac34 W^{\\mathrm{LP}}\\ge\\tfrac34 W^*.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;W(a)\\ge\\tfrac34W^*.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;W(a)\\ge\\tfrac34W^*.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书证明先以 AM–GM 及凹性得到每项的界：1−乘积 ≥ β_d z，其中 β_d=1−(1−1/d)^d。中心点对该项贡献 1−2^(−d)；两者之和至少 3/2（d=1,2 取等，d≥3 时由 7/8+1−1/e&gt;3/2）。乘以正权并求和即得中间界。选两种起点中较好者，逐坐标端点化得到二值解。已核对 Lemma 2.1 和 Theorems 2.28–2.29 的推导；本页只记录数学保证，不宣称这些是目前最优近似比。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-maxsat","status":"resolved","id":"88afb3e9aa26fa43","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-maxsat]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-maxsat","status":"resolved","id":"88afb3e9aa26fa43","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$；$C_k,A_k,B_k,w_k,W,W^*$ 及其全部输入条件如 [[27-df-maxsat]]，$d_k=|A_k|+|B_k|\\ge1$。$F:[0,1]^n\\to\\mathbb R$ 在下节构造。$(x^{\\mathrm{LP}},z^{\\mathrm{LP}})$ 是有界线性规划 $\\max\\{\\sum_k w_kz_k\\mid(x,z)\\in[0,1]^n\\times[0,1]^m,\\ \\forall k\\in[m]\\;z_k\\le\\sum_{i\\in A_k}(1-x_i)+\\sum_{j\\in B_k}x_j\\}$ 的最优解，$W^{\\mathrm{LP}}$ 是下节构造的该最优解的目标值。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"C_k,A_k,B_k,w_k,W,W^*","display":false},{"tex":"d_k=|A_k|+|B_k|\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"F:[0,1]^n\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"(x^{\\mathrm{LP}},z^{\\mathrm{LP}})","display":false},{"tex":"\\max\\{\\sum_k w_kz_k\\mid(x,z)\\in[0,1]^n\\times[0,1]^m,\\ \\forall k\\in[m]\\;z_k\\le\\sum_{i\\in A_k}(1-x_i)+\\sum_{j\\in B_k}x_j\\}","display":false},{"tex":"W^{\\mathrm{LP}}","display":false},{"tex":"F(x)\\coloneqq\\sum_{k=1}^m w_k\\left(1-\\prod_{i\\in A_k}x_i\\prod_{j\\in B_k}(1-x_j)\\right)\\quad(x\\in[0,1]^n),\\qquad W^{\\mathrm{LP}}\\coloneqq\\sum_{k=1}^m w_kz_k^{\\mathrm{LP}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\max\\{F(\\tfrac12,\\ldots,\\tfrac12),F(x^{\\mathrm{LP}})\\}\\ge\\tfrac12\\left(F(\\tfrac12,\\ldots,\\tfrac12)+F(x^{\\mathrm{LP}})\\right)\\ge\\tfrac34 W^{\\mathrm{LP}}\\ge\\tfrac34 W^*.","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;W(a)\\ge\\tfrac34W^*.","display":true}],"bytes":2281,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-maxsatthreequarters|thm-maxsatthreequarters — Combined rounding bound of three quarters for Max Sat]]"}],"outgoing":["88afb3e9aa26fa43"]}